fontmono=no
text=Hearts of ice are used to freeze categories to avoid unwanted prizes. If you would have won a prize in a frozen category, you will win a prize from an unfrozen category.<br><br>You receive Hearts of Ice as a reward for buying treasure hunter keys. You will also get one whenever you get a key, and a bonus of 5 every time you use 5 keys in one day.
